{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122350","id":4265738128,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7-Qf-Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122350","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122350/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122350/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122350/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/622811fde68b2648a9c2f1001e1b892eb0e9295a","number":122350,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[4.7][Project Manager] Fix Wrap Long Project Title","user":{"login":"CarrotOfPower","id":260066004,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4BK1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260066004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower","html_url":"https://github.com/CarrotOfPower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122075\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122257\r\n- Fixes index reuse error noted in PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122037\r\n- Suspendes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095\r\n- Introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119580\r\n\r\n\r\n**This is meant to be cherry-picked for 4.7.2.**\r\n\r\nIt uses a value for `title_size_cache`, different to the PR for 4.8 Master, wich replaces the magic number through logic. This value does work in 4.7.x, but not in 4.8 Master.\r\nThat's ok, since the 4.7 PM layout won't be drastically changed in future.\r\n- **The pendant for 4.8 Master is here:** https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122204 / https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061\r\n\r\n\r\n# What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- **This PR fixes all issues with wrapping project titles.** For more info, see the two suspended PR.\r\n- Simplifies logic significantly while maintaining the same functionality, fixing issues with long project titles not wrapping correctly.\r\n- **Should work on any scale.**\r\n\r\n\r\n## https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122075\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/923d71b1-a738-4f19-af06-a21b2393a258\r\n\r\n\r\n# Difference to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095\r\n\r\n\r\n- Fixes at least one bug contained in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095 (when I write this).\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095 does NOT fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122257.\r\n- Some Optimizations, which also makes the code cleaner to read.\r\n- The behaviour itself:\r\n\r\n### This is https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095:\r\nI cherry-picked [godotengine/godot#122095](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095) for 4.7 and built it using SCons:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab8b5ce0-a24c-4bbe-a67f-193a5e68b99f\r\n\r\n\r\nAs you may notice ...\r\n- The sizing on the right side is not correct.\r\n- The tags do not resize at first, title and tags share the space somewhere in the middle.\r\nAlso, you see the errors from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122257 in the terminal window.\r\n\r\n\r\n### This PR:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bed41e2e-0b54-4685-8f7d-09e912cf0212\r\n\r\n\r\nIt ensures correct sizing and that the tags do resize at first, so the title can take mor space, which can be used more efficiently.\r\nYou don't see any errors in the terminal window.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nValidated by building the Windows editor with SCons and testing it, as well as testing the test artifact for Windows.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7